s a thousand years ago. The small Medicine Spirit Yamao (acted by Sun Zhenni), transformed from the herb Huanyangcao, is chased by all sorts of people due to its magic physique and happens to break in the barrier, leading Qi Fengyin's failure to have a human body and his evil thoughts fly. Since then, the two have had a deep bond and have experienced all kinds of stories together.</p>","updated":1794861235,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/78584"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815299","name":"Episode 15"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815300","name":"Episode 16"}}}}},{"id":3815301,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815301/blossom-in-darkness-1x17-episode-17","name":"Episode 17","season":1,"number":17,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-21","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-11-21T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":47,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815301"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/78584","name":"Blossom in Darkness"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":78584,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/78584/blossom-in-darkness","name":"Blossom in Darkness","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":47,"premiered":"2026-11-15","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.youku.com/v_nextstage/id_adcf514e1f7b412a91e3.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":61,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":118,"name":"Youku","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/651/1629269.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/651/162